%% Container diagram. Every node is a deployable process or service.
flowchart LR
  docket[Docket API\nAthena scheduler and proposal owner]
  gateway[Lovelace Lattice gateway\nOAuth and controller API]
  relay[Lovelace signaling relay\nDurable work and result transport]
  daemon[Mac Studio Lattice daemon\nLease and agent execution]
  lmstudio[Mac Studio LM Studio\nLocal model inference]

  docket -->|1. OAuth-authorized encrypted agent_task| gateway
  gateway -->|2. Account-bound controller request| relay
  relay -->|3. Runtime claims encrypted work| daemon
  daemon -->|4. Local inference| lmstudio
  lmstudio -->|5. Model output| daemon
  daemon -->|6. Sealed terminal result| relay
  relay -->|7. Durable status and ciphertext| gateway
  gateway -->|8. Authorized result response| docket
